<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.844 from 1.834 per dlr in.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.844 from 1.834 per dlr in.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.844 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.834 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    November 5	   November 4</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.844		  1.834</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $14.810 million	  $10.030 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
